WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:07.407
THERE'S GROWING ANGER INSIDE OF RUSSIA,
IN THE AFTERMATH OF A DEADLY

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:10.376
NEW YEAR'S DAY STRIKE ON
RUSSIAN SOLDIERS IN UKRAINE'S

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.812
OCCUPIED DONETSK REGION.
SOME SAY RUSSIAN COMMANDERS

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.649
IGNORED THE DANGERS, THEIR OWN
SOLDIERS, ONE RUSSIAN LAWMAKER

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.686
IS EVEN CALLING FOR PUNISHMENT.
ALSO DISPUTES OVER THE NUMBER

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:30.363
OF RUSSIAN TROOPS KILLED IN
THAT ATTACK.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:37.570
WARNING THAT RUSSIA IS PLANNING
A PROLONGED ATTACK, UKRAINE IS

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.939
GETTING BETTER AT TAKING OUT
DRONES AND SAVORING SMALL

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:50.416
VICTORIES.
&gt;&gt; INTERPRETER: OUR TASK IS TO

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:56.022
--
HUGE SHOT DOWN DRONE, SHOT DOWN

00:00:56.022 --> 00:01:04.230
MISSILE, EACH DAY WITH
ELECTRICITY FOR SCHEDULES OF

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:08.234
POWER OUTAGES.
&gt;&gt; CNN'S SCOTT MCLAIN JOINS US

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:12.272
NOW FROM KYIV.
THIS ATTACK ON MAKIIVKA, IS

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:16.376
INTERESTING TO SEE THE TOLL
NUMBERS FROM UKRAINIANS.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:20.246
INTERESTINGLY, THE CRITICISM
THAT IS COMING WITHIN RUSSIA,

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:24.317
ON COMMANDOES OPERATING ON THE
GROUND, TAKE US THROUGH THE

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:30.523
LATEST.
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE NOT HEARING ANY

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:32.125
CRITICISM FROM WITHIN RUSSIA OF
THE UKRAINIANS.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.461
THIS IS WAR.
WHAT YOU ARE HEARING THOUGH IS

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:39.632
CERTAINLY SOME LEVEL OF
FRUSTRATION WITH THE MILITARY

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:45.705
AND LEADERS WHO ALLOWED THIS TO
HAPPEN, SO MANY RUSSIAN TROOPS

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:51.644
AND EQUIPMENT AND WEAPONRY TO
BE ESSENTIALLY IN THE SAME

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:55.515
PLACE AT THE SAME TIME
ESPECIALLY ON NEW YEAR'S EVE

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:56.816
WHEN RUSSIA WAS LAUNCHING
STRIKES OF ITS OWN.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:02:03.122
ESSENTIALLY MAKING THE TROOPS
AND EQUIPMENT SITTING DUCKS

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:09.128
MAKING THEM PRETTY EASY TARGETS
AS WELL.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:15.268
TEN MONTHS INTO THE WAR, THEY
ARE SAYING THE LESSONS OUGHT TO

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.370
HAVE BEEN LEARNED BY NOW.
PLENTY OF OPEN BUILDINGS AND

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:27.447
PLACES FOR RUSHING SO THAT THEY
ARE NOT DISPERSED, PRO RUSSIAN

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:32.385
OFFICIALS FROM THE DENOTES
PEOPLES REPUBLIC SUGGESTING

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:35.121
THAT THE RUSSIAN MILITARY HAS
UNDERSTOOD THE CAPABILITY OF

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:47.867
THE UKRAINIAN HIMARS SYSTEM.
--

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:56.609
IF YOU BELIEVE THE UKRAINIANS
THE DEATH TOLL WAS 300 WITH 400

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:59.545
INJURED.
THE NUMBERS AT THIS STAGE ARE

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.748
63.
THE PRO-RUSSIAN OFFICIAL IN

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:05.785
THAT DPR E. JEAN SAYS HE
EXPECTS THAT THE FINAL NUMBER

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:10.690
IS IN THE HUNDREDS, OR AT LEAST
MORE THAN 100 AND IF YOU LOOK

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:16.529
AT THE LATEST PICTURE FROM THE
SCENE, IT IS A PILE OF RUBBLE,

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.631
DIFFICULT TO IMAGINE HOW ANYONE
COULD'VE SURVIVED THIS.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:21.601
ONCE A VOCATIONAL SCHOOL IN
MAKIIVKA, WE ALSO HAVE

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:26.673
SATELLITE PICTURES WHICH ARE
LITTLE BIT BLURRY WHICH WAS

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:39.285
ONCE THAT SQUARE, THAT
VOCATIONAL SCHOOL, IT SEEMS

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:43.589
LIKE HEAVY EQUIPMENT, TRYING TO
PICK THROUGH THE RUBBLE AND

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:48.094
COUNT THE DEAD BUT THERE IS NO
CONFIRMATION FROM THE RUSSIAN

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:50.797
SIDE ON HOW HIGH OR IF THAT
DOES FALL WILL INCREASE.

